OL,3,GNEWSA'Devoted and beloved' mum killed
OL,4,Ain crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother who died after her car hit a
OL,7,Fbrick wall had "immeasureable love" for
OL,8,Fher son to whom she was "devoted", her
OL,9,Ffamily have said.
OL,11,FKelly Lundie, 38, was killed on
OL,12,FAllerton Road in Woolton, Liverpool,
OL,13,Fafter her red Nissan Juke crashed just
OL,14,Fafter 23:30 BST on Friday.
OL,16,FMerseyside Police has appealed for any
OL,17,Fwitnesses or doorbell footage.
OL,19,FIn a tribute, her family said she was
OL,20,F"gorgeous, inside and out" and was
OL,21,F"outgoing and full of life".
